+ *
+ * The vendor table is represented here as ordinary 16-bit-address/8-bit-value
+ * writes.  No vendor binary is linked into the kernel.  This is deliberately
+ * the only mode in the first streaming experiment; controls and additional
+ * resolutions are separate follow-up work.
+ */
